title: $:/plugins/rimir/kind/changelog
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

! Changelog

|!Version |!Date |!Changes |
|v0.1.103 |2026-11-11 |Fix: picking a day for a `date` field (editor, field bar inline or popup) saved the 17-char timestamp (`20261111` became `20261111000000000`); the date input now passes `fieldFormat="YYYYMMDD"` to the datepicker, like the cascade palette stores dates. `datetime` is unchanged. |
|v0.1.102 |2026-11-11 |''Instance filter'': `$:/config/rimir/kind/instance-filter` (a filter, e.g. `[!status[archived]]`) applied to kind's instance lists via `kind.visible`; `…/instance-filter/apply-to` = `pickers` (shipped) `cockpit` `overview`. Linked values stay visible (palette toggle/leaf lists use `kind.ref-candidates-keep`). Missing config = unchanged. Ref field dropdown: ↓/↑ highlight, ''Enter'' links, ''Esc'' clears the search (on an empty search the graph modal closes); the search input of a multi field keeps the cursor after a pick. |
|v0.1.101 |2026-11-10 |''Parent'' toolbar button (chevron-up) on kind instances whose `parent` names an existing tiddler: opens the parent right above the instance in the story (moves it there if already open). `kind.up-target`, `kind.up-actions`. |
|v0.1.100 |2026-11-09 |`kind.gm-create-linked` gains optional `seed` (JSON of field values applied before defaults) and `after-link` (procedure run after the link step, with `ctx-a`/`ctx-b`), for rimir/kind-work-focus. |
|v0.1.99 |2026-11-04 |Create form (graph-modal) starts with the cursor in the first field that takes it (`kind.focus-key`, editor `focus-first`); ''Esc'' closes the modal in every mode. Page toolbar create popup gets a search field with the cursor: typing narrows the kinds (`kind.create-menu-match`), ''Enter'' picks the first, ''Esc'' closes. |
|v0.1.98 |2026-11-03 |Focus: Shift-click on the focus button keeps the story and opens the found tiddlers additionally, right after the instance (`kind.focus-actions` gets `add`). |
|v0.1.97 |2026-11-03 |Field bar icons carry `data-kind-src`, `data-kind-field` and `data-kind-ref="yes"` (ref fields), so bridges can attach to a field; rimir/ports 0.1.4 drags new links out of ref field icons. |
|v0.1.96 |2026-11-03 |Fix: a folded tiddler no longer shows the field bar and the cockpit (they ended up below the core unfold bar since 0.1.95); both check the core fold state via `kind.unfolded` and are not rendered while folded. |
|v0.1.95 |2026-11-03 |Tiddler field bar sits below the subtitle (modified date) instead of above it, and is compact: the `<p>` wrappers TW puts around the bar and its inline pieces take no box any more (`display: contents`), which removes the extra space above and below it (also in stream rows). |
|v0.1.94 |2026-11-03 |''Focus rules'': `$:/config/rimir/kind/focus/<kind-key>` holds one filter per line (`<host>` = the focused instance, `#` comments); each line is its own filter, results are grouped by line and latest modified first within a line, without repeats. No rules tiddler = the shipped default (`parent` children, as before). New `kind.focus-parent`; the type-builder offers ''＋ rules'' / ''rules'' next to the focus checkbox. FAQ example for a person (children, open stakeholder topics, informed notes). |
|v0.1.93 |2026-11-03 |''New kind instance'' page toolbar button: pick a kind of the active namespace, fill the create form, the new instance opens. `kind.gm-create` is the shared create entry (`kind.gm-add-child` now delegates to it); the create-modal header leaves out "under …" without a host. The quick-start steps link to the type-builder tab. |
|v0.1.92 |2026-11-03 |''Focus'': `kind.focus: yes` on a type adds a toolbar button (close-others icon) to its instances that sets the story to the instance plus the tiddlers whose `parent` it is, latest modified first (own stream rows excluded). Children are looked up on click only (`kind.focus-actions`). Checkbox in the type-builder. |
|v0.1.91 |2026-11-03 |''Groups'': `kind.group-of: <field>` makes a kind a group of that field's members (e.g. team → person); multi ref fields that take the member kind but not the group kind offer groups and link their current members instead (ref picker, palette multi-ref stage, `schema.groupMembers` for rimir/ports). ''Spawns'': `kind.spawns: <kind>[:<field>]` adds ''＋ <Kind>'' buttons to the field bar; the create form gets the link (default `parent`) and the host's same-named fields (groups expanded; computed and defaulted fields left out). Both settable in the type-builder. Fix: `kind.field-prop` no longer returns an empty string for a missing prop, so fallbacks such as the field key as caption work again (blank section titles in the cockpit, blank field in the create-modal header). |
|v0.1.90 |2026-11-03 |The ''▸ Connections'' toggle moved into the tiddler's field bar (`kind.cockpit-toggle`, last item), which is now right-aligned under the title (`tiddler-bar=yes`; stream rows keep their left-aligned bar without toggle). Cockpit gates shared by bar and panel: `kind.cockpit-host`, `kind.cockpit-relations`, `kind.cockpit-generic-on`, `kind.cockpit-open-state`, `kind.cockpit-open`. |
|v0.1.89 |2026-11-03 |Generic cockpit starts collapsed behind a ''▸ Connections'' toggle, open state per instance (`$:/state/rimir/kind/cockpit/open/<instance>`); while collapsed its sections and click-mode row are not rendered, so their instance scans only run when opened. Custom cockpits unchanged. |
|v0.1.88 |2026-10-31 |New type field `kind.title-fixed: yes`: the title formula is applied once on creation and never re-checked, so surrogate titles (e.g. a UTC timestamp, with the name in `caption`) no longer show up as title mismatches in the validator. Create-form previews label it "title on save" (`kind.title-preview-label`); checkbox in the type builder. |
|v0.1.87 |2026-10-29 |Generic ''cockpit'' (`cockpit.tid`) replaces the hard-wired person-view / conversation-view: outgoing section per own ref field, incoming section per (kind, field) pair, each with ＋ to create, link (both ends for `inverse`) and open a new instance; `kind.cockpit` on a type = blank (generic) / `none` / custom cockpit title. Create-form drafts under `$:/state/` / `$:/temp/` are no longer instances (inverse sync, candidates). Kinds without title-formula are saved under their caption instead of the draft title (`kind.create-title`). Documented the `kixam/datepicker` dependency of date fields. |
|v0.1.86 |2026-10-29 |Two-way links: a `ref` field def may carry `"inverse": "<field>"`; `inverse.js` (with browser-only `inverse-startup.js`) mirrors every link onto the target's field and removes it again, driven by wiki change events so all write paths are covered (drafts on save, deletes and retypes release targets, no back-fill when a type gains `inverse`). New `schema.js` library with JS schema helpers shared with [[rimir/ports|$:/plugins/rimir/ports]]. First JS modules in kind. Docs: reference, architecture, overview, FAQ. |
|v0.1.85 |2026-07-14 |`kind.finalize-create` gains an optional `after-create` argument — the name of a global procedure invoked //inside// its `$action-createtiddler`, where `<<createTiddler-title>>` is the fresh post-uniquification title (so a caller can react to the new instance without hitting the async-savetitle staleness). Must be a `$variable` transclude (a `$tiddler` one crashes during the createtiddler's argument-less `refreshChildren`). `entity-actions` gains matching passthroughs (`ea-after-create` + `ea-ctx-a`/`ea-ctx-b`, stored on the modal state). Empty = no-op, so all existing create flows are unchanged. Used by [[rimir/dashboard|$:/plugins/rimir/dashboard]] to drop a tile for a newly-created child into the same group. |
|v0.1.84 |2026-07-14 |The graph tooltip's node actions are now reusable outside the graph. Extracted the modal-driving actions into shared engine procedures (`kind.gm-edit` / `kind.gm-delete` / `kind.gm-add-child`) and added a self-contained `$:/plugins/rimir/kind/entity-actions` tiddler that renders the //edit// + //Add child// cluster for any instance (reads `ea-entity` from scope). The //Instances Overview// tooltip now uses these procedures too (no behaviour change); [[rimir/dashboard|$:/plugins/rimir/dashboard]] uses `entity-actions` to offer entity edit / add-child on kind-instance tiles. |
|v0.1.83 |2026-07-14 |''Instances Overview'' layout: the ''Edges'' controls now sit on their own row (own `.kg-controls` block) instead of trailing the search row, matching the ''Types'' row. |
|v0.1.82 |2026-07-14 |''Instances Overview'' search gains a ''keep view & highlight'' mode: instead of shrinking the graph to just the matches and refitting (still the default), it holds the current zoom/pan and greys out non-matches so you can see //where// matches sit in the whole picture (persisted to `$:/config/rimir/kind/instances-overview/search-mode`). Added a clear (✕) button next to the search box. Search wiring now lives in the shared `kg-graph` renderer (new `searchText`/`searchMode` params), so the Context preview is unaffected. |
|v0.1.81 |2026-07-08 |New per-kind story-river cockpit ViewTemplates: ''person-view'' (instances referencing the person, grouped/ranked, with role + status filters) and ''conversation-view'' (Participants · editable Minutes · Notes). Shared notes/content helpers moved from `palette/preview/notes.tid` into `engine.tid`. |
|v0.1.80 |2026-07-08 |Story-river kind-type picker: click the field-bar type icon to change/remove the type; untyped tiddlers get an optional ''＋ type'' assign dropdown (settings toggle + qualifying filter). Fixes: single-value fields with spaces no longer split on a comma in the bar; popup field editor now autofocuses (and inline-mode validation now engages). |
|v0.1.79 |2026-06-15 |Fix: cascade-palette rows whose caption / title / value contained a `"` (or `\`) silently vanished — hand-built row JSON now escapes embedded display text (`kind.json-escape`, routed through `kind.kv`). |
|v0.1.78 |2026-06-11 |//Notes// side-preview: related list restricted to configured note-kinds (`$:/config/rimir/kind/notes-preview/kinds`, default `note`); empty notes get a ''＋'' add-node button and an ''✎ Text'' inline editor. |
|v0.1.77 |2026-06-11 |New //Notes// cascade-palette side-preview: an instance's own content (text + Streams structure) plus every note / child pointing to it, newest-first; Stream / Tabbed layout toggle. (Streams soft-dep.) |
|v0.1.76 |2026-06-11 |Creation wizard: date-step pre-fill (`ca-step-date-default`), force-land-in-optional (`ca-step-auto-edit`), and finish returns to the launching entity. |
|v0.1.75 |2026-06-10 |Creation wizard: per-instance preferred ''spawn-locations'' — ★-pinned quick-pick rows at the top of the parent-picker (new `kind.spawn-locations` common field). |
|v0.1.74 |2026-06-10 |Creation wizard: runtime ⇄ switch between tree and flat parent-picker layouts, remembered per step. |
|v0.1.73 |2026-06-10 |Creation wizard: hands-free step landing, drillable tree parent-picker (pick = create), per-node graph preview, return-to-entity on finish. |
|v0.1.72 |2026-06-10 |Designer-defined multi-step creation wizards — a kind can be created via an ordered guided flow (steps tagged `$:/tags/rimir/kind/wizard-step`) instead of one all-fields form. |
|v0.1.71 |2026-06-09 |Fix: auto-children now reliably inherit their parent — nest `apply-auto-children` inside `$action-createtiddler` + read `<<createTiddler-title>>` (the sibling `$savetitle` read was stale). |
|v0.1.70 |2026-06-09 |Reverse-reference navigation — a "Referenced by…" drill from any instance back to the instances that reference it, grouped per relation with per-kind group/sort config. |
|v0.1.69 |2026-06-09 |Fix: Instances Overview edge selection now persists — renamed the storage field from `fields` (collides with the TiddlyWeb sync wire-format container) to `edges`. |
|v0.1.68 |2026-06-08 |Quick-create drill (subset of fields + derived caption), per-ref ''Manage <field>…'' actions, and a duration / daterange widget. Ref / enum pickers now float selected entries to the top. |
|v0.1.66 |2026-06-04 |Kind icon lens declares `ca-lens-actions: via-entity-type` so Open / Edit / Delete stay available even when the Icon lens slot is off. (cascade-palette ≥0.0.111) |
|v0.1.65 |2026-06-04 |"Kind icons" migrated from structure-toggle to a ''Kind'' icon ''lens'' (Icon slot); same behaviour, off by default. (cascade-palette ≥0.0.110) |
|v0.1.64 |2026-06-04 |Graph tooltip node actions (edit / delete / Add child per accepting kind) + a `graph-modal` overlay, on Instances Overview and Context preview nodes. |
